<dialog id="cookie_modal" class="modal">
    <div class="modal-box w-full max-w-2xl max-h-screen overflow-y-auto">
        <form method="dialog">
            <button class="btn btn-sm btn-circle btn-ghost absolute right-2 top-2">✕</button>
        </form>

        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2">Cookie Policy & Terms</h3>
        <p class="text-sm"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> October 2025</p>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm mt-4">
            <p>
                Our website uses cookies to ensure proper site functionality and enhance your browsing experience.
            </p>

            <h4 class="font-semibold">Types of Cookies:</h4>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                <li><strong>Necessary/Technical Cookies:</strong> Required for the website to work correctly (e.g., session management).</li>
                <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> Help us understand how visitors interact with the site (e.g., Google Analytics). These are anonymous and do not personally identify you.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>
                <strong>Cookie Retention Period:</strong> Your cookie consent is stored for up to 12 months. After this period, consent will expire, and you will be prompted again.
            </p>

            <p>
                <strong>Managing & Withdrawing Consent:</strong> You can manage your cookie preferences at any time by clicking the “Update Preferences” button in this modal or in the footer.
                Disabling necessary cookies may affect website functionality.
            </p>

            <p>
                By clicking “Accept all”, you consent to the use of analytics cookies. You can always change your preferences with the button below.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-4">
                <button
                        class="btn btn-sm btn-info"
                        id="cookie_preferences_btn"
                        onclick="cookie_modal.close()"
                >
                    Update Preferences
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <form method="dialog" class="modal-backdrop">
        <button>Close</button>
    </form>
</dialog>